    "summary": "Personally read all40 original PDF pages visually, compared all18 complete question/key blocks to canonical and preserved dirty baselines, and inspected all15 exact current published crops plus the fresh native p17 crop. Only the existing p12 lyrics omission placeholder becomes an original-source page link and the p17 cropped F label is restored. The dirty p17 proposal loses S and is rejected; the dirty p18 proposal is unnecessary and rejected. Fourteen canonical crops and all18 complete keys are preserved. Three raw mechanical text-layer findings were source-confirmed false positives: a word split across page boundaries and two descriptive alt-text verbs. Automated checks are gates, without independent review or a separate model checker.",
